<Layout title="Golf Course Engagement Console — StickLink Golf" description="A course operator view for connected golf touchpoints, golfer participation, repeat visits, commerce attribution, and sponsor activations." eyebrow="COURSE CONSOLE / CEDAR RIDGE GOLF CLUB">
  <section class="page shell"><div class="eyebrow">THE OPERATOR VIEW</div><h1>Make the invisible visible.</h1><p class="page-lead">A calm operating view for the moments that happen across the property—and the revenue, repeat visits, and relationships that follow them.</p>
    <div class="dashboard"><div class="panel"><h2>Today's connected activity</h2><div class="stat-grid"><div class="stat"><b>126</b><span>Unique golfers</span></div><div class="stat"><b>418</b><span>Tap events</span></div><div class="stat"><b>34%</b><span>Repeat visitors</span></div></div><div class="activity"><div class="activity-icon">●</div><div><b>Red Tail challenge is live</b><small>42 golfers entered · 9:58 AM</small></div></div><div class="activity"><div class="activity-icon">$</div><div><b>Halfway House orders</b><small>18 orders attributed · $312.40</small></div></div><div class="activity"><div class="activity-icon">✦</div><div><b>Northstar sponsor drop</b><small>63 claims · 21% tap-to-claim</small></div></div></div><div class="panel"><h2>Active touchpoints</h2><div class="activity"><div class="activity-icon">✓</div><div><b>18 tee markers</b><small>Connected and healthy</small></div></div><div class="activity"><div class="activity-icon">✓</div><div><b>04 hospitality points</b><small>Connected and healthy</small></div></div><div class="activity"><div class="activity-icon" style="background:#f1d0b8">!</div><div><b>Cart 031</b><small>Needs attention</small></div></div><a class="button secondary" style="margin-top:20px" href="/course/cedar-ridge/">Preview golfer experience ↗</a></div></div>
    <div class="operator-tools"><article><span>01 · COURSE PROFILE</span><h2>Edit the course record.</h2><p>Review address, operator-seeded coordinates, holes, tees, and data sources before publication.</p></article><article><span>02 · MAP APPROVAL</span><h2>Approve geometry.</h2><p>Every boundary, hole, hazard, green, tee, and StickLink location keeps an operator approval event.</p></article><article><span>03 · SCORE REVIEW</span><h2>Verify with evidence.</h2><p>Tap events, witness confirmation, round audit history, and rejection reasons stay attached to the round.</p></article><article><span>04 · LEAGUES + ANNOUNCEMENTS</span><h2>Keep the network alive.</h2><p>Create public or private leagues, publish results, and share course updates without touching money.</p></article></div><div class="source-note"><strong>OPERATOR SAFETY</strong><span>All writes require the existing service-auth seam plus organization and actor headers. This pilot does not infer membership from a client-supplied organization id; production identity integration remains a State of Stick boundary.</span></div>
  </section>
</Layout>
